  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To find a DS through ONS Bootstrapping, we start by"
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "checking if the input is a \"URN\"."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "If it is, we proceed with the step of \"ONS-Resolving URN to a domain-name\"."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If the input is a \"URL\", we simply continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "After this, we again check if the input is a \"URN\" or a \"URL\" and take the corresponding action."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "Once we have resolved the URN to a domain-name, we send a DNS query."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "The result of this query is a list of URLs, which we then use to link to a designated DS."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "Finally, we link to the designated DS and the process comes to an end."
    }
  ]
